# Security Negative Proof

Native app no-claim boundaries preserved:

- Inventory is not app use.
- Running is not foreground.
- Foreground is not content.
- AI cannot enforce.
- Manual-required states do not call adapters.
- Raw private executable paths are not added to activity-surface rows.
- Service read-model projection does not add broad app blocking.

